data: {"type": "semantic.event", "occurred_at": "2026-06-26T06:37:42.233458+00:00", "payload": {"schema_version": "clio.semantic_event.v1", "event_id": "sem_1b8c817245eb4533", "event_type": "expert.response.completed", "session_id": "sess_57ac84d71ca3", "workspace_id": "ws_22a00fecef95", "trace_id": "trace_msg_user_b0b5df728a09", "turn_id": "msg_user_b0b5df728a09", "span_id": "sem_1b8c817245eb4533", "parent_span_id": "", "status": "completed", "summary": "Expert main produced a response.", "live_observed": true, "detail_level": "semantic", "occurred_at": "2026-06-26T06:37:42.232201+00:00", "actor": {"agent_id": "main"}, "subject": {}, "blueprint": {"agent_blueprint_id": "earthscope-gnss-region", "parent_expert": ""}, "provider": {"provider_id": "", "model_id": ""}, "payload": {"selected_expert": "main", "route_source": "agent_blueprint", "route_reason": "Session selected Agent Blueprint expert 'main'.", "answer": "(Delegating to data expert for station discovery; no final answer yet.)", "expert_handoffs": [], "tools_called": [], "file_diffs": [], "error_info": null, "reasoning": "The geospatial expert has successfully resolved \"Los Angeles\" to a precise, grounded region (center 34.0536909\u00b0N, -118.242766\u00b0W, radius 100 km, high confidence via OpenStreetMap Nominatim). \n\nThe user's original request asks for a full investigation: resolve geography \u2713, discover EarthScope/earthquake evidence, analyze events and station context, and produce an artifact for discussion. This is a full-pipeline request.\n\nThe next step is to discover and rank EarthScope/NDP GNSS stations within the resolved Los Angeles region. The data expert will search for available stations, rank candidates by spatial fit and data availability, and stage a time-series CSV if a suitable station resource exists. This staged station data will feed downstream analysis and visualization steps."}}}

