it\": 10}, \"_meta\": {\"tool\": \"search_datasets\", \"status\": \"success\"}}"}, {"name": "ndp_stage_resource", "args": {"url": "https://nationaldataplatform.org/catalog/dataset/811f0bcc-99e5-455c-bcf6-7c63c2634f41/resource/a420cc30-2262-423a-8c63-3ad8d91f2a8f/download/earthscope_converted_data.csv", "output_dir": "/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws"}, "ok": true, "duration_ms": 986.3094309985172, "telemetry_source": "blueprint_react_tool_wrapper", "result": "{\"ok\": true, \"local_path\": \"/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/earthscope_converted_data.csv\", \"size_bytes\": 153082, \"content_type\": \"text/csv\", \"url\": \"https://nationaldataplatform.org/catalog/dataset/811f0bcc-99e5-455c-bcf6-7c63c2634f41/resource/a420cc30-2262-423a-8c63-3ad8d91f2a8f/download/earthscope_converted_data.csv\", \"method\": \"http\", \"_meta\": {\"tool\": \"stage_resource\", \"status\": \"success\"}}"}, {"name": "shell_bash", "args": {"command": "cut -d, -f1-3 '/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/earthscope_converted_data.csv' > '/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/earthscope_stations_clean.csv'"}, "ok": false, "duration_ms": 23.281030007638037, "telemetry_source": "blueprint_react_tool_wrapper", "result": "{\"error\": {\"type\": \"file_policy\", \"code\": \"outside_allowed_roots\", \"message\": \"Path is outside allowed roots: /home/jcernuda/clio-agent\", \"field\": \"cwd\", \"path\": \"/home/jcernuda/clio-agent\", \"next_action\": \"Move the file under an allowed root or set CLIO_ALLOWED_ROOTS.\", \"details\": {\"allowed_roots\": [\"/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws\", \"/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run\"]}}}"}, {"name": "shell_bash", "args": {"command": "cut -d, -f1-3 '/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/earthscope_converted_data.csv' > '/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/earthscope_stations_clean.csv'", "cwd": "/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws"}, "ok": true, "duration_ms": 319.5353449846152, "telemetry_source": "blueprint_react_tool_wrapper", "result": "{\"command\": \"cut -d, -f1-3 '/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/earthscope_converted_data.csv' > '/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/earthscope_stations_clean.csv'\", \"cwd\": \"/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws\", \"exit_code\": 0, \"stdout\": \"\", \"stderr\": \"\", \"timed_out\": false, \"timeout_s\": 5.0, \"stdout_truncated\": false, \"stderr_truncated\": false}"}], "file_diffs": [], "error_info": null, "trajectory": {"thought_0": "I need to discover and stage the EarthScope station metadata catalog for the Los Angeles region. The system prompt specifies exactly three tool calls in strict order:\n\n1. **STEP 1 (this call)**: Search NDP for the EarthScope station metadata catalog using the exact search terms `[\"earthscope\", \"converted\"]` with limit 10. This should return the `earthscope_stations` dataset whose resource is named `earthscope_converted_data.csv` with a download URL.\n\n2. **STEP 2 (next)**: Stage that catalog CSV by its URL using `ndp_stage_resource`, writing to the Active workspace root at `/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws`.\n\n3. **STEP 3 (final)**: Clean the raw catalog with `shell_bash` to remove the misaligned header and keep only the first three columns (station id and coordinates).\n\nI must not deviate from this sequence or add any other searches. Starting with STEP 1 now.", "tool_name_0": "ndp_search_datasets", "tool_args_0": {"search_terms": ["earthscope", "converted"], "limit": 10}, "observation_0": "{\"datasets\": [{\"id\": \"811f0bcc-99e5-455c-bcf6-7c63c2634f41\", \"name\": \"earthscope_stations\", \"title\": \"EarthScope Stations Dataset\", \"owner_org\": null, \"notes\": \"The EarthScope Consortium streams three-dimensional GNSS high rate (1Hz) position time series from nearly a thousand GNSS stations to study earthquakes, volcanos, tsunamis, hydrologic loads, and glaciers. The data is made available via the National Data Platform pilot project.\\n[touch 2025-10-29 15:44:20]\", \"resources\": [{\"id\": \"a420cc30-2262-423a-8c63-3ad8d91f2a8f\", \"url\": \"https://nationaldataplatform.org/catalog/dataset/811f0bcc-99e5-455c-bcf6-7c63c2634f41/resource/a420cc30-2262-423a-8c63-3ad8d91f2a8f/download/earthscope_converted_data.csv\", \"name\": \"earthscope_converted_data.csv\", \"description\": null, \"format\": \"CSV\"}], \"extras\": {\"data_policy\": \"https://www.unavco.org/data/policies_forms/data-policy/data-policy-realtime-streaming-gps/data-policy-realtime-streaming-gps.html\", \"organization_url\": \"https://www.earthscope.org\"}}], \"count\": 1, \"total_found\": 1, \"server\": \"global\", \"search_parameters\": {\"search_terms\": [\"earthscope\", \"converted\"], \"search_keys\": null, \"dataset_name\": null, \"dataset_title\": null, \"owner_org\": null, \"resource_format\": null, \"search_term\": null, \"filter_list\": null, \"limit\": 10}, \"_meta\": {\"tool\": \"search_datasets\", \"status\": \"success\"}}", "thought_1": "STEP 1 succeeded! The search returned exactly one dataset: `earthscope_stations` (ID: `811f0bcc-99e5-455c-bcf6-7c63c2634f41`) with the resource `earthscope_converted_data.csv` at the URL:\n`https://nationaldataplatform.org/catalog/dataset/811f0bcc-99e5-455c-bcf6-7c63c2634f41/resource/a420cc30-2262-423a-8c63-3ad8d91f2a8f/download/earthscope_converted_data.csv`\n\nNow I proceed to STEP 2: stage this catalog CSV to the Active workspace root (`/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws`) using `ndp_stage_resource`. I will pass the exact URL and the output directory, but no `output_name` (let the tool derive the filename).", "tool_name_1": "ndp_stage_resource", "tool_args_1": {"url": "https://nationaldataplatform.org/catalog/dataset/811f0bcc-99e5-455c-bcf6-7c63c2634f41/resource/a420cc30-2262-423a-8c63-3ad8d91f2a8f/download/earthscope_converted_data.csv", "output_dir": "/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws"}, "observation_1": "{\"ok\": true, \"local_path\": \"/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/earthscope_converted_data.csv\", \"size_bytes\": 153082, \"content_type\": \"text/csv\", \"url\": \"https://nationaldataplatform.org/catalog/dataset/811f0bcc-99e5-455c-bcf6-7c63c2634f41/resource/a420cc30-2262-423a-8c63-3ad8d91f2a8f/download/earthscope_converted_data.csv\", \"method\": \"http\", \"_meta\": {\"tool\": \"stage_resource\", \"status\": \"success\"}}", "thought_2": "STEP 2 succeeded! The catalog was staged to:\n`/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/earthscope_converted_data.csv`\n\nNow I proceed to STEP 3 (final): clean the raw catalog with `shell_bash`. I need to extract just the first three columns (station id and two coordinate columns) to remove the misaligned header problem, and write the result to the workspace root as `earthscope_stations_clean.csv`.\n\nThe command is: `cut -d, -f1-3 '<RAW>' > '<WORKSPACE>/earthscope_stations_clean.csv'`\n\nI must NOT chain commands or add extra operations. After this step completes, I will finish with the metadata_path set to the cleaned CSV.", "tool_name_2": "shell_bash", "tool_args_2": {"command": "cut -d, -f1-3 '/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/earthscope_converted_data.csv' > '/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/earthscope_stations_clean.csv'"}, "observation_2": "{\"error\": {\"type\": \"file_policy\", \"code\": \"outside_allowed_roots\", \"message\": \"Path is outside allowed roots: /home/jcernuda/clio-agent\", \"field\": \"cwd\", \"path\": \"/home/jcernuda/clio-agent\", \"next_action\": \"Move the file under an allowed root or set CLIO_ALLOWED_ROOTS.\", \"details\": {\"allowed_roots\": [\"/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws\", \"/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run\"]}}}", "thought_3": "STEP 3 encountered a file policy error. The shell_bash tool's default working directory is outside the allowed roots. I need to specify the `cwd` parameter to set the working directory to an allowed root. The allowed roots are:\n- `/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws`\n- `/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run`\n\nI'll retry the same `cut` command but with `cwd` set to the workspace root. The command itself is correct and within the allowed roots; I just need to set the working directory properly.", "tool_name_3": "shell_bash", "tool_args_3": {"command": "cut -d, -f1-3 '/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/earthscope_converted_data.csv' > '/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/earthscope_stations_clean.csv'", "cwd": "/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws"}, "observation_3": "{\"command\": \"cut -d, -f1-3 '/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/earthscope_converted_data.csv' > '/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/earthscope_stations_clean.csv'\", \"cwd\": \"/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws\", \"exit_code\": 0, \"stdout\": \"\", \"stderr\": \"\", \"timed_out\": false, \"timeout_s\": 5.0, \"stdout_truncated\": false, \"stderr_truncated\": false}", "thought_4": "STEP 3 succeeded! The `cut` command completed successfully (exit_code=0) and created the cleaned file at:\n`/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/earthscope_stations_clean.csv`\n\nAll three required tool calls have now been completed:\n1. \u2713 STEP 1: Searched NDP and found the `earthscope_stations` dataset\n2. \u2713 STEP 2: Staged the raw `earthscope_converted_data.csv` to the workspace\n3. \u2713 STEP 3: Cleaned the raw catalog to keep only the first three columns (station id and coordinates)\n\nNow I must call finish and emit the final workflow_state with `acquisition.metadata_path` set to the cleaned workspace path, along with all required resource candidate information and status fields.", "tool_name_4": "finish", "tool_args_4": {}, "observation_4": "Completed."}, "reasoning": "All three required tool calls have been successfully completed in strict sequence:\n\n1. **STEP 1 (Search)**: `ndp_search_datasets` with exact terms `[\"earthscope\", \"converted\"]` returned the `earthscope_stations` dataset (ID: `811f0bcc-99e5-455c-bcf6-7c63c2634f41`) containing one resource: `earthscope_converted_data.csv`.\n\n2. **STEP 2 (Stage)**: `ndp_stage_resource` successfully downloaded and staged the EarthScope station metadata catalog to the workspace root at `/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/earthscope_converted_data.csv` (153,082 bytes, CSV format).\n\n3. **STEP 3 (Clean)**: `shell_bash` with `cut -d, -f1-3` successfully extracted the first three columns (station ID and two coordinate columns) and wrote the cleaned file to `/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/earthscope_stations_clean.csv`, removing the misaligned header that repeated the name `(deg)`.\n\nThe metadata path is now set to the cleaned CSV as required by the contract, not the raw catalog."}}}

