data: {"type": "message.part.added", "occurred_at": "2026-06-26T06:39:00.945745+00:00", "payload": {"turn_id": "msg_user_b0b5df728a09", "message_id": "msg_asst_b3567fb7ada5", "stream_source": "live", "part": {"id": "live_handoff_7eef95ff8ee3", "type": "expert_handoff", "metadata": {"delegate_to": "ndp_dataset_discovery", "agent_id": "ndp_dataset_discovery", "question": "Search NDP for EarthScope/UNAVCO GNSS station-metadata catalogs. Stage the station-metadata CSV file (containing station IDs, network codes, locations, and data-availability information) so it can be spatially filtered to identify stations within the Los Angeles region (center 34.0536909\u00b0N, -118.242766\u00b0W, radius 100 km).", "status": "completed", "execute": true, "source": "agent_next_expert", "parent_id": "data", "pack_id": "earthscope-gnss-region", "pack_version": "0.1.0", "provider_id": "", "model_id": "", "fallback_warnings": [], "stage": "delegate.completed", "delegation_lifecycle": "sync", "return_to": "data", "depth": 0, "duration_ms": 56881, "execution_mode": "blueprint_react", "input": "Search NDP for EarthScope/UNAVCO GNSS station-metadata catalogs. Stage the station-metadata CSV file (containing station IDs, network codes, locations, and data-availability information) so it can be spatially filtered to identify stations within the Los Angeles region (center 34.0536909\u00b0N, -118.242766\u00b0W, radius 100 km).\n\nParent evidence available for this delegated task:\n\n(Delegating to ndp_dataset_discovery for EarthScope metadata discovery; no answer yet.)\n\nAccumulated typed workflow state from prior CLIO tool evidence (authoritative; use this before local prose summaries):\n{\"workflow_state\": {\"completed_stages\": [\"geospatial\"], \"geospatial\": {\"bbox\": [-118.6681798, 33.659541, -118.1552983, 34.337306], \"center_lat\": 34.0536909, \"center_lon\": -118.242766, \"confidence\": \"high\", \"provenance\": \"osm_nominatim\", \"radius_km\": 100, \"region_name\": \"Los Angeles, Los Angeles County, California, United States\", \"status\": \"resolved\", \"warnings\": [\"Default radius of 100 km assumed for regional GNSS station discovery and seismic event analysis; no explicit radius specified in user request\"]}, \"orchestrator_step\": \"delegating_to_data\", \"request_type\": \"full_pipeline\", \"user_request_summary\": \"Explore recent seismic activity around Los Angeles; resolve geography, find EarthScope/earthquake evidence, analyze events and stations, produce artifact\"}}", "output": "EarthScope station metadata catalog successfully discovered and staged.\n\n**Cleaned metadata CSV path:** `/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/earthscope_stations_clean.csv`\n\n**Source URL:** `https://nationaldataplatform.org/catalog/dataset/811f0bcc-99e5-455c-bcf6-7c63c2634f41/resource/a420cc30-2262-423a-8c63-3ad8d91f2a8f/download/earthscope_converted_data.csv`\n\n**Dataset:** EarthScope Stations Dataset (earthscope_stations, ID: 811f0bcc-99e5-455c-bcf6-7c63c2634f41)\n\n**Resource:** earthscope_converted_data.csv (CSV, 153 KB)\n\nThe cleaned file contains station IDs and coordinate columns, ready for spatial filtering to the Los Angeles region (center 34.0536909\u00b0N, -118.242766\u00b0W, radius 100 km).", "workflow_state": {"completed_stages": ["geospatial"], "geospatial": {"bbox": [-118.6681798, 33.659541, -118.1552983, 34.337306], "center_lat": 34.0536909, "center_lon": -118.242766, "confidence": "high", "provenance": "osm_nominatim", "radius_km": 100, "region_name": "Los Angeles, Los Angeles County, California, United States", "status": "resolved", "warnings": ["Default radius of 100 km assumed for regional GNSS station discovery and seismic event analysis; no explicit radius specified in user request"]}, "orchestrator_step": "delegating_to_data", "request_type": "full_pipeline", "user_request_summary": "Explore recent seismic activity around Los Angeles; resolve geography, find EarthScope/earthquake evidence, analyze events and stations, produce artifact", "catalog": {"status": "metadata_found"}, "acquisition": {"status": "metadata_only", "metadata_path": "/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/earthscope_stations_clean.csv", "metadata_source_url": "https://nationaldataplatform.org/catalog/dataset/811f0bcc-99e5-455c-bcf6-7c63c2634f41/resource/a420cc30-2262-423a-8c63-3ad8d91f2a8f/download/earthscope_converted_data.csv", "analysis_ready": false}}, "tools_called": [{"name": "ndp_search_datasets", "args": {"search_terms": ["earthscope", "converted"], "limit": 10}, "ok": true, "telemetry_source": "agent_trajectory", "result": "{\"datasets\": [{\"id\": \"811f0bcc-99e5-455c-bcf6-7c63c2634f41\", \"name\": \"earthscope_stations\", \"title\": \"EarthScope Stations Dataset\", \"owner_org\": null, \"notes\": \"The EarthScope Consortium streams three-dimensional GNSS high rate (1Hz) position time series from nearly a thousand GNSS stations to study earthquakes, volcanos, tsunamis, hydrologic loads, and glaciers. The data is made available via the National Data Platform pilot project.\\n[touch 2025-10-29 15:44:20]\", \"resources\": [{\"id\": \"a420cc30-2262-423a-8c63-3ad8d91f2a8f\", \"url\": \"https://nationaldataplatform.org/catalog/dataset/811f0bcc-99e5-455c-bcf6-7c63c2634f41/resource/a420cc30-2262-423a-8c63-3ad8d91f2a8f/download/earthscope_converted_data.csv\", \"name\": \"earthscope_converted_data.csv\", \"description\": null, \"format\": \"CSV\"}], \"extras\": {\"data_policy\": \"https://www.unavco.org/data/policies_forms/data-policy/data-policy-realtime-streaming-gps/data-policy-realtime-streaming-gps.html\", \"organization_url\": \"https://www.earthscope.org\"}}], \"count\": 1, \"total_found\": 1, \"server\": \"global\", \"search_parameters\": {\"search_terms\": [\"earthscope\", \"converted\"], \"search_keys\": null, \"dataset_name\": null, \"dataset_title\": null, \"owner_org\": null, \"resource_format\": null,