data: {"type": "semantic.event", "occurred_at": "2026-06-26T06:39:53.839938+00:00", "payload": {"schema_version": "clio.semantic_event.v1", "event_id": "sem_061caa99380d4072", "event_type": "react.step.completed", "session_id": "sess_57ac84d71ca3", "workspace_id": "ws_22a00fecef95", "trace_id": "trace_msg_user_b0b5df728a09", "turn_id": "msg_user_b0b5df728a09", "span_id": "sem_061caa99380d4072", "parent_span_id": "64867730c3e74a7b", "status": "completed", "summary": "earthscope_station_catalog ReAct step 2: finish", "live_observed": true, "detail_level": "semantic", "occurred_at": "2026-06-26T06:39:53.831602+00:00", "actor": {"agent_id": "earthscope_station_catalog", "role": "expert"}, "subject": {}, "blueprint": {}, "provider": {}, "payload": {"expert_id": "earthscope_station_catalog", "expert_span_id": "64867730c3e74a7b", "step_span_id": "afa6fe51f23641bd", "step_index": 2, "thought": "Perfect! The `geo_filter_points_by_radius` tool succeeded with excellent results:\n\n- **within_radius_count**: 155 stations found within the 100 km Los Angeles region\n- **skipped_invalid**: 0 (no parsing errors - the column identification was correct)\n- **Points**: 155 ranked stations sorted by distance from center (34.0536909\u00b0N, -118.242766\u00b0W)\n\nThe ranked stations include many high-quality candidates with excellent proximity:\n- MTA1 (0.3 km) - closest station, nearly at the center\n- PKRD (2.2 km)\n- ELSC (4.1 km)\n- USC2 (5.0 km)\n- SILK (5.8 km)\n...and 150 more within the radius, sorted by distance\n\nThis represents strong EarthScope/GNSS coverage in the Los Angeles region. Now I need to finish this task by emitting the ranked workflow_state with all station IDs and building resource discovery queries for the resolver to stage the most promising time-series CSVs.\n\nI'll include all 155 station IDs in `station_catalog.station_ids` and provide search queries for the top candidates to give the resolver good fallback options.\n</thinking>", "reasoning": "", "tool_name": "finish", "tool_args": {}, "observation": "Completed.", "is_finish": true}}}

