6.641, \"id\": \"P612\", \"Site\": \"P612\"}, {\"distance_km\": 87.8182, \"id\": \"ELSG\", \"Site\": \"ELSG\"}, {\"distance_km\": 88.1255, \"id\": \"OVLS\", \"Site\": \"OVLS\"}, {\"distance_km\": 88.4353, \"id\": \"HIVI\", \"Site\": \"HIVI\"}, {\"distance_km\": 89.0394, \"id\": \"ECFS\", \"Site\": \"ECFS\"}, {\"distance_km\": 89.4471, \"id\": \"P577\", \"Site\": \"P577\"}, {\"distance_km\": 89.582, \"id\": \"RMVJ\", \"Site\": \"RMVJ\"}, {\"distance_km\": 89.6796, \"id\": \"P560\", \"Site\": \"P560\"}, {\"distance_km\": 90.2864, \"id\": \"P470\", \"Site\": \"P470\"}, {\"distance_km\": 90.6974, \"id\": \"P582\", \"Site\": \"P582\"}, {\"distance_km\": 90.9706, \"id\": \"RCSC\", \"Site\": \"RCSC\"}, {\"distance_km\": 91.4488, \"id\": \"RSTP\", \"Site\": \"RSTP\"}, {\"distance_km\": 91.7639, \"id\": \"TPOG\", \"Site\": \"TPOG\"}, {\"distance_km\": 93.6659, \"id\": \"P808\", \"Site\": \"P808\"}, {\"distance_km\": 94.8093, \"id\": \"VNCO\", \"Site\": \"VNCO\"}, {\"distance_km\": 95.2076, \"id\": \"ALPP\", \"Site\": \"ALPP\"}, {\"distance_km\": 96.2485, \"id\": \"NHRG\", \"Site\": \"NHRG\"}, {\"distance_km\": 96.7199, \"id\": \"BAR1\", \"Site\": \"BAR1\"}, {\"distance_km\": 96.9436, \"id\": \"HVYS\", \"Site\": \"HVYS\"}, {\"distance_km\": 97.0534, \"id\": \"MSOB\", \"Site\": \"MSOB\"}, {\"distance_km\": 97.8969, \"id\": \"SONG\", \"Site\": \"SONG\"}, {\"distance_km\": 99.1327, \"id\": \"P554\", \"Site\": \"P554\"}, {\"distance_km\": 99.7366, \"id\": \"SCIA\", \"Site\": \"SCIA\"}]}", "thought_2": "Perfect! The `geo_filter_points_by_radius` tool succeeded with excellent results:\n\n- **within_radius_count**: 155 stations found within the 100 km Los Angeles region\n- **skipped_invalid**: 0 (no parsing errors - the column identification was correct)\n- **Points**: 155 ranked stations sorted by distance from center (34.0536909\u00b0N, -118.242766\u00b0W)\n\nThe ranked stations include many high-quality candidates with excellent proximity:\n- MTA1 (0.3 km) - closest station, nearly at the center\n- PKRD (2.2 km)\n- ELSC (4.1 km)\n- USC2 (5.0 km)\n- SILK (5.8 km)\n...and 150 more within the radius, sorted by distance\n\nThis represents strong EarthScope/GNSS coverage in the Los Angeles region. Now I need to finish this task by emitting the ranked workflow_state with all station IDs and building resource discovery queries for the resolver to stage the most promising time-series CSVs.\n\nI'll include all 155 station IDs in `station_catalog.station_ids` and provide search queries for the top candidates to give the resolver good fallback options.\n</thinking>", "tool_name_2": "finish", "tool_args_2": {}, "observation_2": "Completed."}, "reasoning": "The `geo_filter_points_by_radius` tool successfully filtered the EarthScope station metadata catalog to the Los Angeles region using the resolved geographic parameters:\n- Center: 34.0536909\u00b0N, -118.242766\u00b0W\n- Radius: 100 km\n- Catalog file: earthscope_stations_clean.csv (cleaned to remove misaligned headers)\n- Column identification: Site (station IDs), Latitude (latitude values), (deg) (longitude values)\n\nThe tool result shows:\n- **within_radius_count**: 155 stations\n- **skipped_invalid**: 0 (perfect parsing, no errors)\n- **source**: EarthScope station metadata catalog with within-radius points sorted by distance\n\nAll 155 returned stations are grounded in the tool's actual spatial filtering result - none are invented, all fall within the 100 km radius, and all are ranked by their great-circle distance from the Los Angeles center. This represents substantial EarthScope/GNSS coverage in the region with multiple fallback options."}}}

