data: {"type": "message.part.added", "occurred_at": "2026-06-26T06:40:19.011460+00:00", "payload": {"turn_id": "msg_user_b0b5df728a09", "message_id": "msg_asst_b3567fb7ada5", "stream_source": "live", "part": {"id": "live_handoff_6a0cf6467d9b", "type": "expert_handoff", "metadata": {"delegate_to": "earthscope_station_catalog", "agent_id": "earthscope_station_catalog", "question": "Spatially filter the EarthScope station metadata catalog (at `/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/earthscope_stations_clean.csv`) to the Los Angeles region (center 34.0536909\u00b0N, -118.242766\u00b0W, radius 100 km) and rank nearby stations by proximity and suitability for analyzing regional ground deformation.", "status": "completed", "execute": true, "source": "agent_next_expert", "parent_id": "data", "pack_id": "earthscope-gnss-region", "pack_version": "0.1.0", "provider_id": "", "model_id": "", "fallback_warnings": [], "stage": "delegate.completed", "delegation_lifecycle": "sync", "return_to": "data", "depth": 0, "duration_ms": 58217, "execution_mode": "blueprint_react", "input": "Spatially filter the EarthScope station metadata catalog (at `/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/earthscope_stations_clean.csv`) to the Los Angeles region (center 34.0536909\u00b0N, -118.242766\u00b0W, radius 100 km) and rank nearby stations by proximity and suitability for analyzing regional ground deformation.\n\nParent evidence available for this delegated task:\n\n(Delegating to earthscope_station_catalog for spatial filtering and ranking; no final answer yet.)\n\nAccumulated typed workflow state from prior CLIO tool evidence (authoritative; use this before local prose summaries):\n{\"workflow_state\": {\"acquisition\": {\"analysis_ready\": false, \"metadata_path\": \"/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/earthscope_stations_clean.csv\", \"metadata_source_url\": \"https://nationaldataplatform.org/catalog/dataset/811f0bcc-99e5-455c-bcf6-7c63c2634f41/resource/a420cc30-2262-423a-8c63-3ad8d91f2a8f/download/earthscope_converted_data.csv\", \"status\": \"metadata_only\"}, \"catalog\": {\"status\": \"metadata_found\"}, \"completed_stages\": [\"geospatial\"], \"geospatial\": {\"bbox\": [-118.6681798, 33.659541, -118.1552983, 34.337306], \"center_lat\": 34.0536909, \"center_lon\": -118.242766, \"confidence\": \"high\", \"provenance\": \"osm_nominatim\", \"radius_km\": 100, \"region_name\": \"Los Angeles, Los Angeles County, California, United States\", \"status\": \"resolved\", \"warnings\": [\"Default radius of 100 km assumed for regional GNSS station discovery and seismic event analysis; no explicit radius specified in user request\"]}, \"orchestrator_step\": \"delegating_to_data\", \"request_type\": \"full_pipeline\", \"user_request_summary\": \"Explore recent seismic activity around Los Angeles; resolve geography, find EarthScope/earthquake evidence, analyze events and stations, produce artifact\"}}", "output": "**Ranked EarthScope GNSS Station Candidates for Los Angeles Region**\n\nSuccessfully identified **155 EarthScope/GNSS stations** within the Los Angeles region (center 34.0536909\u00b0N, -118.242766\u00b0W, radius 100 km). Stations are ranked by proximity to the region center and ready for time-series resource resolution.\n\n**Top candidates (closest to center):**\n1. **MTA1** (0.3 km) \u2014 nearly at region center\n2. **PKRD** (2.2 km)\n3. **ELSC** (4.1 km)\n4. **USC2** (5.0 km)\n5. **SILK** (5.8 km)\n6. **OXYC** (9.0 km)\n7. **P800** (10.4 km)\n8. **LEE2** (11.6 km)\n\n**Coverage distribution:** Stations span the full Los Angeles metropolitan area and surrounding region, with dense clustering near the city center and strong distribution across the greater LA basin out to the 100 km radius. This provides excellent regional deformation monitoring capability and multiple fallback stations for analysis.", "workflow_state": {"acquisition": {"analysis_ready": false, "metadata_path": "/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/earthscope_stations_clean.csv", "metadata_source_url": "https://nationaldataplatform.org/catalog/dataset/811f0bcc-99e5-455c-bcf6-7c63c2634f41/resource/a420cc30-2262-423a-8c63-3ad8d91f2a8f/download/earthscope_converted_data.csv", "status": "metadata_only"}, "catalog": {"status": "metadata_found"}, "completed_stages": ["geospatial"], "geospatial": {"bbox": [-118.6681798, 33.659541, -118.1552983, 34.337306], "center_lat": 34.0536909, "center_lon": -118.242766, "confidence": "high", "provenance": "osm_nominatim", "radius_km": 100, "region_name": "Los Angeles, Los Angeles County, California, United States", "status": "resolved", "warnings": ["Default radius of 100 km assumed for regional GNSS station discovery and seismic event analysis; no explicit radius specified in user request"]}, "orchestrator_step": "delegating_to_data", "request_type": "full_pipeline", "user_request_summary": "Explore recent seismic activity around Los Angeles; resolve geography, find EarthScope/earthquake evidence, analyze events and stations, produce artifact", "station_catalog": {"status": "ranked", "candidate_count": 155, "station_ids": ["MTA1", "PKRD", "ELSC", "USC2", "SILK", "OXYC", "P800", "LEE2", "LEEP", "GVRS", "BGIS", "NOPK", "MHMS", "VDCY", "CIT1", "MILK", "BRAN", "P799", "HOLP", "LFRS", "DYH2", "WNRA", "BKMS", "JPLM", "FCTF", "UCLP", "WRHS", "RHCL", "WHC1", "CSDH", "RHCG", "LONG", "CRHS", "WLSN", "VIMT", "LBC1", "LPHS", "WMAP", "TORP", "LBCH", "LBC2", "HBCO", "WCHS", "CVHS", "PVRS", "SNHS", "PVHS", "AZU1", "CGDM", "LAPC", "CSN1", "DAM3", "DAM2", "BLSA", "VNCX", "P517", "P587", "CMP9", "CBHS", "SPMS", "CHIL", "SPK1", "PVE3", "VTIS", "PSDM", "CCCS", "ROCK", "LORS", "SACY", "SKYB", "TWMS", "CLAR", "VNPS", "JNHG", "FVPK", "DVPB", "ELLY", "CJVG", "OEOC", "LRRG", "HOL3", "PBPP", "TOST", "LL01", "CTDM", "P574", "CNPP", "TRAK",