data: {"type": "semantic.event", "occurred_at": "2026-06-26T06:40:44.721939+00:00", "payload": {"schema_version": "clio.semantic_event.v1", "event_id": "sem_bcae82eea0d6403a", "event_type": "expert.response.completed", "session_id": "sess_57ac84d71ca3", "workspace_id": "ws_22a00fecef95", "trace_id": "trace_msg_user_b0b5df728a09", "turn_id": "msg_user_b0b5df728a09", "span_id": "sem_bcae82eea0d6403a", "parent_span_id": "", "status": "completed", "summary": "Expert data produced a response.", "live_observed": true, "detail_level": "semantic", "occurred_at": "2026-06-26T06:40:44.708501+00:00", "actor": {"agent_id": "data"}, "subject": {}, "blueprint": {"agent_blueprint_id": "earthscope-gnss-region", "parent_expert": "main"}, "provider": {"provider_id": "", "model_id": ""}, "payload": {"selected_expert": "data", "route_source": "agent_blueprint", "route_reason": "Session selected Agent Blueprint expert 'data'.", "answer": "(Delegating to ndp_resource_resolver for station time-series CSV staging; no final answer yet.)", "expert_handoffs": [], "tools_called": [], "file_diffs": [], "error_info": null, "reasoning": "The data acquisition workflow has progressed through two successful stages:\n\n1. **ndp_dataset_discovery** (complete): Successfully discovered and staged the EarthScope station metadata catalog to `/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/earthscope_stations_clean.csv`\n\n2. **earthscope_station_catalog** (complete): Successfully ranked 155 EarthScope/GNSS stations within the Los Angeles region (100 km radius). Station ranking is ordered by proximity to center, with MTA1 (0.3 km) as the closest candidate.\n\n**Current state:** \n- Ranked candidates available: \u2713 155 stations\n- Station time-series CSV staged: \u2717 NOT YET (acquisition.status = \"metadata_only\")\n- Analysis-ready status: false\n\nAccording to the system prompt, the data branch is **NOT complete** when the catalog ranks stations \u2014 that is only a list of candidate IDs, not the data itself. The required hand-off chain requires a third and final stage: `ndp_resource_resolver` must stage a real station-specific time-series CSV with concrete `acquisition.status=staged`, `acquisition.analysis_ready=true`, and `acquisition.local_path` evidence.\n\nThe next step is to delegate to `ndp_resource_resolver` to stage the time-series CSV for the top-ranked station candidates, starting with the closest: MTA1 (0.3 km from center) and fallback options."}}}

