data: {"type": "semantic.event", "occurred_at": "2026-06-26T06:40:55.079775+00:00", "payload": {"schema_version": "clio.semantic_event.v1", "event_id": "sem_d4e67f88c4cb4680", "event_type": "react.step.completed", "session_id": "sess_57ac84d71ca3", "workspace_id": "ws_22a00fecef95", "trace_id": "trace_msg_user_b0b5df728a09", "turn_id": "msg_user_b0b5df728a09", "span_id": "sem_d4e67f88c4cb4680", "parent_span_id": "1f1673e630ab4282", "status": "completed", "summary": "ndp_resource_resolver ReAct step 0: ndp_search_datasets", "live_observed": true, "detail_level": "semantic", "occurred_at": "2026-06-26T06:40:55.073396+00:00", "actor": {"agent_id": "ndp_resource_resolver", "role": "expert"}, "subject": {}, "blueprint": {}, "provider": {}, "payload": {"expert_id": "ndp_resource_resolver", "expert_span_id": "1f1673e630ab4282", "step_span_id": "d27caf13330044d2", "step_index": 0, "thought": "I have 155 ranked EarthScope GNSS station candidates for the Los Angeles region, with MTA1 as the closest (0.3 km from center). The task requires me to stage the actual time-series CSV files \u2014 not just plan to do it, but actually call the tools and download them.\n\nAccording to the system prompt, I must:\n1. Search NDP for the station's time-series dataset using `ndp_search_datasets` with the station id\n2. Find the per-station CSV resource (named like `<station_id>.*.csv`)\n3. Stage the CSV using `ndp_stage_resource` with the resource URL\n4. Record the staged path and metadata\n\nI'm starting with MTA1 (the closest candidate). If its dataset/CSV is unavailable, I'll move to the next ranked candidates: PKRD, ELSC, USC2, SILK, etc.\n\nFirst step: Search NDP for MTA1's time-series dataset.\n</thinking>", "reasoning": "", "tool_name": "ndp_search_datasets", "tool_args": {"dataset_title": "MTA1", "limit": 20}, "observation": "{\"datasets\": [{\"id\": \"1b0c1b93-f164-4025-bd7b-000252b5ca18\", \"name\": \"mta1-ci-ly-30\", \"title\": \"MTA1.CI.LY_.30\", \"owner_org\": \"earthscope_consortium\", \"notes\": \"The EarthScope Consortium streams three-dimensional GNSS high rate (1 Hz) position time series from nearly a thousand GNSS stations to study earthquakes, volcanoes, tsunamis, hydrologic loads, and glaciers. The data is made available via the National Data Platform pilot project.\", \"resources\": [{\"id\": \"2ec8d2ee-2c3a-451c-8515-4e109e911737\", \"url\": \"https://ds2.datacollaboratory.org/Earthscope_api_dec2024/raw_csv/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv\", \"name\": \"MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv\", \"description\": \"EarthScope CSV\", \"format\": \"CSV\"}, {\"id\": \"db766d8d-aaee-41bd-82c8-20fd3ac5bbf8\", \"url\": \"https://ds2.datacollaboratory.org/Earthscope_api_dec2024/generated_png/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.png\", \"name\": \"MTA1.CI.LY_.30.png\", \"description\": \"Preview image\", \"format\": \"PNG\"}, {\"id\": \"9a6cc25f-c6ba-4511-8338-e8d718939de3\", \"url\": \"https://di.ndp.utah.edu/datasets/339c7577-adb1-4f8b-a1c2-a45ef2db142e\", \"name\": \"Contextual Insight Dashboard\", \"description\": \"Dashboard\", \"format\": \"HTML\"}], \"extras\": {\"affinity_dataset_uuid\": \"9571e3cc-309b-44ee-bb71-28b77784d898\", \"affinity_endpoint_uuids\": \"[\\\"66dd11c0-44e2-48a6-bc02-a2c568c3a5a8\\\"]\", \"affinity_service_uuids\": \"[\\\"3a5562fc-4f8f-4d6a-985e-c6965f02129a\\\", \\\"5bbe2d35-bf69-4232-9462-aab3a56f8be1\\\", \\\"710d3ae5-971d-4946-9f1e-14f3ec2adae8\\\"]\", \"affinity_triplet_uuid\": \"13507868-11d6-45e2-b201-f100c7344ab6\", \"contextual_insight_id\": \"339c7577-adb1-4f8b-a1c2-a45ef2db142e\", \"documentation_links\": \"{\\\"EarthScope GNSS Realtime\\\": \\\"https://www.earthscope.org/data/gnss-realtime/\\\", \\\"GAGE/UNAVCO Data Access Methods\\\": \\\"https://www.unavco.org/data/gps-gnss/data-access-methods/data-access-methods.html\\\", \\\"GAGE GPS/GNSS Data Overview\\\": \\\"https://www.unavco.org/data/gps-gnss/gps-gnss.html\\\"}\", \"end_time\": \"2024-12-12T23:59:47Z\", \"spatial\": \"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"Point\\\",\\\"coordinates\\\":[-118.245498776,34.055218051]}\", \"start_time\": \"2024-12-03T00:00:00Z\", \"temporal\": \"{\\\"startTime\\\": \\\"2024-12-03T00:00:00Z\\\", \\\"endTime\\\": \\\"2024-12-12T23:59:47Z\\\"}\"}}], \"count\": 1, \"total_found\": 1, \"server\": \"global\", \"search_parameters\": {\"search_terms\": null, \"search_keys\": null, \"dataset_name\": null, \"dataset_title\": \"MTA1\", \"owner_org\": null, \"resource_format\": null, \"search_term\": null, \"filter_list\": null, \"limit\": 20}, \"_meta\": {\"tool\": \"search_datasets\", \"status\": \"success\"}}", "is_finish": false}}}

