118.245498776,34.055218051]}\", \"start_time\": \"2024-12-03T00:00:00Z\", \"temporal\": \"{\\\"startTime\\\": \\\"2024-12-03T00:00:00Z\\\", \\\"endTime\\\": \\\"2024-12-12T23:59:47Z\\\"}\"}}], \"count\": 1, \"total_found\": 1, \"server\": \"global\", \"search_parameters\": {\"search_terms\": null, \"search_keys\": null, \"dataset_name\": null, \"dataset_title\": \"MTA1\", \"owner_org\": null, \"resource_format\": null, \"search_term\": null, \"filter_list\": null, \"limit\": 20}, \"_meta\": {\"tool\": \"search_datasets\", \"status\": \"success\"}}"}, {"name": "ndp_stage_resource", "args": {"url": "https://ds2.datacollaboratory.org/Earthscope_api_dec2024/raw_csv/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv", "max_bytes": 60000000}, "ok": true, "telemetry_source": "agent_trajectory", "result": "{\"ok\": true, \"local_path\": \"/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv\", \"size_bytes\": 50424246, \"content_type\": \"text/csv\", \"url\": \"https://ds2.datacollaboratory.org/Earthscope_api_dec2024/raw_csv/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv\", \"method\": \"http\", \"_meta\": {\"tool\": \"stage_resource\", \"status\": \"success\"}}"}, {"name": "finish", "args": {}, "ok": true, "telemetry_source": "agent_trajectory", "result": "Completed."}, {"name": "ndp_search_datasets", "args": {"dataset_title": "MTA1", "limit": 20}, "ok": true, "duration_ms": 467.6115089969244, "telemetry_source": "blueprint_react_tool_wrapper", "result": "{\"datasets\": [{\"id\": \"1b0c1b93-f164-4025-bd7b-000252b5ca18\", \"name\": \"mta1-ci-ly-30\", \"title\": \"MTA1.CI.LY_.30\", \"owner_org\": \"earthscope_consortium\", \"notes\": \"The EarthScope Consortium streams three-dimensional GNSS high rate (1 Hz) position time series from nearly a thousand GNSS stations to study earthquakes, volcanoes, tsunamis, hydrologic loads, and glaciers. The data is made available via the National Data Platform pilot project.\", \"resources\": [{\"id\": \"2ec8d2ee-2c3a-451c-8515-4e109e911737\", \"url\": \"https://ds2.datacollaboratory.org/Earthscope_api_dec2024/raw_csv/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv\", \"name\": \"MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv\", \"description\": \"EarthScope CSV\", \"format\": \"CSV\"}, {\"id\": \"db766d8d-aaee-41bd-82c8-20fd3ac5bbf8\", \"url\": \"https://ds2.datacollaboratory.org/Earthscope_api_dec2024/generated_png/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.png\", \"name\": \"MTA1.CI.LY_.30.png\", \"description\": \"Preview image\", \"format\": \"PNG\"}, {\"id\": \"9a6cc25f-c6ba-4511-8338-e8d718939de3\", \"url\": \"https://di.ndp.utah.edu/datasets/339c7577-adb1-4f8b-a1c2-a45ef2db142e\", \"name\": \"Contextual Insight Dashboard\", \"description\": \"Dashboard\", \"format\": \"HTML\"}], \"extras\": {\"affinity_dataset_uuid\": \"9571e3cc-309b-44ee-bb71-28b77784d898\", \"affinity_endpoint_uuids\": \"[\\\"66dd11c0-44e2-48a6-bc02-a2c568c3a5a8\\\"]\", \"affinity_service_uuids\": \"[\\\"3a5562fc-4f8f-4d6a-985e-c6965f02129a\\\", \\\"5bbe2d35-bf69-4232-9462-aab3a56f8be1\\\", \\\"710d3ae5-971d-4946-9f1e-14f3ec2adae8\\\"]\", \"affinity_triplet_uuid\": \"13507868-11d6-45e2-b201-f100c7344ab6\", \"contextual_insight_id\": \"339c7577-adb1-4f8b-a1c2-a45ef2db142e\", \"documentation_links\": \"{\\\"EarthScope GNSS Realtime\\\": \\\"https://www.earthscope.org/data/gnss-realtime/\\\", \\\"GAGE/UNAVCO Data Access Methods\\\": \\\"https://www.unavco.org/data/gps-gnss/data-access-methods/data-access-methods.html\\\", \\\"GAGE GPS/GNSS Data Overview\\\": \\\"https://www.unavco.org/data/gps-gnss/gps-gnss.html\\\"}\", \"end_time\": \"2024-12-12T23:59:47Z\", \"spatial\": \"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"Point\\\",\\\"coordinates\\\":[-118.245498776,34.055218051]}\", \"start_time\": \"2024-12-03T00:00:00Z\", \"temporal\": \"{\\\"startTime\\\": \\\"2024-12-03T00:00:00Z\\\", \\\"endTime\\\": \\\"2024-12-12T23:59:47Z\\\"}\"}}], \"count\": 1, \"total_found\": 1, \"server\": \"global\", \"search_parameters\": {\"search_terms\": null, \"search_keys\": null, \"dataset_name\": null, \"dataset_title\": \"MTA1\", \"owner_org\": null, \"resource_format\": null, \"search_term\": null, \"filter_list\": null, \"limit\": 20}, \"_meta\": {\"tool\": \"search_datasets\", \"status\": \"success\"}}"}, {"name": "ndp_stage_resource", "args": {"url": "https://ds2.datacollaboratory.org/Earthscope_api_dec2024/raw_csv/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv", "max_bytes": 60000000}, "ok": true, "duration_ms": 12627.723812009208, "telemetry_source": "blueprint_react_tool_wrapper", "result": "{\"ok\": true, \"local_path\": \"/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv\", \"size_bytes\": 50424246, \"content_type\": \"text/csv\", \"url\": \"https://ds2.datacollaboratory.org/Earthscope_api_dec2024/raw_csv/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv\", \"method\": \"http\", \"_meta\": {\"tool\": \"stage_resource\", \"status\": \"success\"}}"}], "file_diffs": [], "error_info": null, "trajectory": {"thought_0": "I have 155 ranked EarthScope GNSS station candidates for the Los Angeles region, with MTA1 as the closest (0.3 km from center). The task requires me to stage the actual time-series CSV files \u2014 not just plan to do it, but actually call the tools and download them.\n\nAccording to the system prompt, I must:\n1. Search NDP for the station's time-series dataset using `ndp_search_datasets` with the station id\n2. Find the per-station CSV resource (named like `<station_id>.*.csv`)\n3. Stage the CSV using `ndp_stage_resource` with the resource URL\n4. Record the staged path and metadata\n\nI'm starting with MTA1 (the closest candidate). If its dataset/CSV is unavailable, I'll move to the next ranked candidates: PKRD, ELSC, USC2, SILK, etc.\n\nFirst step: Search NDP for MTA1's time-series dataset.\n</thinking>", "tool_name_0": "ndp_search_datasets", "tool_args_0": {"dataset_title": "MTA1", "limit": 20}, "observation_0": "{\"datasets\": [{\"id\": \"1b0c1b93-f164-4025-bd7b-000252b5ca18\", \"name\": \"mta1-ci-ly-30\", \"title\": \"MTA1.CI.LY_.30\", \"owner_org\": \"earthscope_consortium\", \"notes\": \"The EarthScope Consortium streams three-dimensional GNSS high rate (1 Hz) position time series from nearly a thousand GNSS stations to study earthquakes, volcanoes, tsunamis, hydrologic loads, and glaciers. The data is made available via the National Data Platform pilot project.\", \"resources\": [{\"id\": \"2ec8d2ee-2c3a-451c-8515-4e109e911737\", \"url\": \"https://ds2.datacollaboratory.org/Earthscope_api_dec2024/raw_csv/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv\", \"name\": \"MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv\", \"description\": \"EarthScope CSV\", \"format\": \"CSV\"}, {\"id\": \"db766d8d-aaee-41bd-82c8-20fd3ac5bbf8\", \"url\": \"https://ds2.datacollaboratory.org/Earthscope_api_dec2024/generated_png/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.png\", \"name\": \"MTA1.CI.LY_.30.png\", \"description\": \"Preview image\", \"format\": \"PNG\"}, {\"id\": \"9a6cc25f-c6ba-4511-8338-e8d718939de3\", \"url\": \"https://di.ndp.utah.edu/datasets/339c7577-adb1-4f8b-a1c2-a45ef2db142e\", \"name\": \"Contextual Insight Dashboard\", \"description\": \"Dashboard\", \"format\": \"HTML\"}], \"extras\": {\"affinity_dataset_uuid\": \"9571e3cc-309b-44ee-bb71-28b77784d898\", \"affinity_endpoint_uuids\": \"[\\\"66dd11c0-44e2-48a6-bc02-a2c568c3a5a8\\\"]\", \"affinity_service_uuids\": \"[\\\"3a5562fc-4f8f-4d6a-985e-c6965f02129a\\\", \\\"5bbe2d35-bf69-4232-9462-aab3a56f8be1\\\", \\\"710d3ae5-971d-4946-9f1e-14f3ec2adae8\\\"]\", \"affinity_triplet_uuid\": \"13507868-11d6-45e2-b201-f100c7344ab6\", \"contextual_insight_id\": \"339c7577-adb1-4f8b-a1c2-a45ef2db142e\", \"documentation_links\": \"{\\\"EarthScope GNSS Realtime\\\": \\\"https://www.earthscope.org/data/gnss-realtime/\\\", \\\"GAGE/UNAVCO Data Access Methods\\\": \\\"https://www.unavco.org/data/gps-gnss/data-access-methods/data-access-methods.html\\\", \\\"GAGE GPS/GNSS Data Overview\\\": \\\"https://www.unavco.org/data/gps-gnss/gps-gnss.html\\\"}\", \"end_time\": \"2024-12-12T23:59:47Z\", \"spatial\": \"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"Point\\\",\\\"coordinates\\\":[-118.245498776,34.055218051]}\", \"start_time\": \"2024-12-03T00:00:00Z\", \"temporal\": \"{\\\"startTime\\\": \\\"2024-12-03T00:00:00Z\\\", \\\"endTime\\\": \\\"2024-12-12T23:59:47Z\\\"}\"}}], \"count\": 1, \"total_found\": 1, \"server\": \"global\", \"search_parameters\": {\"search_terms\": null, \"search_keys\": null, \"dataset_name\": null, \"dataset_title\": \"MTA1\", \"owner_org\": null, \"resource_format\": null, \"search_term\": null, \"filter_list\": null, \"limit\": 20}, \"_meta\": {\"tool\": \"search_datasets\", \"status\": \"success\"}}", "thought_1": "Excellent! The search found the MTA1 time-series dataset. The result shows:\n- Dataset: \"MTA1.CI.LY_.30\" (EarthScope GNSS time-series)\n- CSV resource: \"MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv\" at URL `https://ds2.datacollaboratory.org/Earthscope_api_dec2024/raw_csv/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv`\n- Temporal range: 2024-12-03 to 2024-12-12 (recent data)\n- Spatial location: [-118.245498776, 34.055218051] (very close to MTA1's location)\n\nThis is the actual station time-series CSV I need to stage (not the metadata catalog). Now I'll stage this CSV file using `ndp_stage_resource` with the CSV URL and a higher max_bytes limit (60MB) to handle the station data.\n</thinking>", "tool_name_1": "ndp_stage_resource", "tool_args_1": {"url": "https://ds2.datacollaboratory.org/Earthscope_api_dec2024/raw_csv/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv", "max_bytes": 60000000}, "observation_1": "{\"ok\": true, \"local_path\": \"/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv\", \"size_bytes\": 50424246, \"content_type\": \"text/csv\", \"url\": \"https://ds2.datacollaboratory.org/Earthscope_api_dec2024/raw_csv/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv\", \"method\": \"http\", \"_meta\": {\"tool\": \"stage_resource\", \"status\": \"success\"}}", "thought_2": "Perfect! The MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv file has been successfully staged. The observation shows:\n- Local path: `/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv`\n- File size: 50,424,246 bytes (~50 MB)\n- Content type: text/csv\n- Source URL: `https://ds2.datacollaboratory.org/Earthscope_api_dec2024/raw_csv/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv`\n\nThe MTA1 station time-series CSV is now staged and ready for analysis. I have successfully completed the data acquisition task:\n1. \u2713 Searched for MTA1's time-series dataset in NDP\n2. \u2713 Found the per-station CSV resource (MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv)\n3. \u2713 Staged the CSV file to the workspace\n\nNow I need to finish the task and provide the final workflow_state with all acquisition metadata set to reflect the staged, analysis-ready status.\n</thinking>", "tool_name_2": "finish", "tool_args_2": {}, "observation_2": "Completed."}, "reasoning": "Successfully staged the MTA1 EarthScope GNSS time-series CSV through a two-step process:\n\n1. **Dataset Discovery**: Searched NDP for \"MTA1\" and found the EarthScope dataset \"MTA1.CI.LY_.30\" containing three resources: the CSV time-series, a PNG preview, and a dashboard link.\n\n2. **Resource Staging**: Staged the actual time-series CSV (MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv) from the NDP data repository using ndp_stage_resource with a 60 MB size limit to accommodate the station data. The staging succeeded immediately, returning the local path and confirming the file size (50.4 MB).\n\nThe MTA1 station was the closest candidate (0.3 km from Los Angeles center) and its time-series data is now available for downstream analysis. The CSV contains recent GNSS displacement data (2024-12-03 to 2024-12-12) from coordinates very close to MTA1's registered location."}}}

