data: {"type": "semantic.event", "occurred_at": "2026-06-26T06:41:37.930738+00:00", "payload": {"schema_version": "clio.semantic_event.v1", "event_id": "sem_bde03bcb11874595", "event_type": "blueprint.delegation.completed", "session_id": "sess_57ac84d71ca3", "workspace_id": "ws_22a00fecef95", "trace_id": "trace_msg_user_b0b5df728a09", "turn_id": "msg_user_b0b5df728a09", "span_id": "sem_bde03bcb11874595", "parent_span_id": "", "status": "completed", "summary": "ndp_resource_resolver returned a compact result to data.", "live_observed": true, "detail_level": "semantic", "occurred_at": "2026-06-26T06:41:37.899938+00:00", "actor": {"agent_id": "ndp_resource_resolver", "role": "child_expert"}, "subject": {"agent_id": "data", "role": "parent_expert"}, "blueprint": {"pack_id": "earthscope-gnss-region", "pack_version": "0.1.0", "agent_blueprint_id": "earthscope-gnss-region", "parent_expert": "data", "child_expert": "ndp_resource_resolver"}, "provider": {"provider_id": "", "model_id": ""}, "payload": {"delegate_to": "ndp_resource_resolver", "agent_id": "ndp_resource_resolver", "question": "Stage the time-series CSV for the top-ranked EarthScope station candidate MTA1 (0.3 km from Los Angeles center) and provide fallback options if MTA1 is unavailable. Search NDP for the station-specific time-series resource and stage the CSV with columns including time, east, north, and up displacement components. Required columns: time, east, north, up. Fallback candidates (in order of proximity): PKRD (2.2 km), ELSC (4.1 km), USC2 (5.0 km), SILK (5.8 km).", "status": "completed", "execute": true, "source": "agent_next_expert", "parent_id": "data", "pack_id": "earthscope-gnss-region", "pack_version": "0.1.0", "provider_id": "", "model_id": "", "fallback_warnings": [], "stage": "delegate.completed", "delegation_lifecycle": "sync", "return_to": "data", "depth": 0, "duration_ms": 49724, "execution_mode": "blueprint_react", "input": "Stage the time-series CSV for the top-ranked EarthScope station candidate MTA1 (0.3 km from Los Angeles center) and provide fallback options if MTA1 is unavailable. Search NDP for the station-specific time-series resource and stage the CSV with columns including time, east, north, and up displacement components. Required columns: time, east, north, up. Fallback candidates (in order of proximity): PKRD (2.2 km), ELSC (4.1 km), USC2 (5.0 km), SILK (5.8 km).\n\nParent evidence available for this delegated task:\n\n(Delegating to ndp_resource_resolver for station time-series CSV staging; no final answer yet.)\n\nAccumulated typed workflow state from prior CLIO tool evidence (authoritative; use this before local prose summaries):\n{\"workflow_state\": {\"acquisition\": {\"analysis_ready\": false, \"metadata_path\": \"/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/earthscope_stations_clean.csv\", \"metadata_source_url\": \"https://nationaldataplatform.org/catalog/dataset/811f0bcc-99e5-455c-bcf6-7c63c2634f41/resource/a420cc30-2262-423a-8c63-3ad8d91f2a8f/download/earthscope_converted_data.csv\", \"status\": \"metadata_only\"}, \"catalog\": {\"status\": \"metadata_found\"}, \"completed_stages\": [\"geospatial\"], \"geospatial\": {\"bbox\": [-118.6681798, 33.659541, -118.1552983, 34.337306], \"center_lat\": 34.0536909, \"center_lon\": -118.242766, \"confidence\": \"high\", \"provenance\": \"osm_nominatim\", \"radius_km\": 100, \"region_name\": \"Los Angeles, Los Angeles County, California, United States\", \"status\": \"resolved\", \"warnings\": [\"Default radius of 100 km assumed for regional GNSS station discovery and seismic event analysis; no explicit radius specified in user request\"]}, \"orchestrator_step\": \"delegating_to_data\", \"request_type\": \"full_pipeline\", \"station_catalog\": {\"candidate_count\": 155, \"station_ids\": [\"MTA1\", \"PKRD\", \"ELSC\", \"USC2\", \"SILK\", \"OXYC\", \"P800\", \"LEE2\", \"LEEP\", \"GVRS\", \"BGIS\", \"NOPK\", \"MHMS\", \"VDCY\", \"CIT1\", \"MILK