data: {"type": "semantic.event", "occurred_at": "2026-06-26T06:43:06.598828+00:00", "payload": {"schema_version": "clio.semantic_event.v1", "event_id": "sem_d1c84a2f068a41c8", "event_type": "expert.response.completed", "session_id": "sess_57ac84d71ca3", "workspace_id": "ws_22a00fecef95", "trace_id": "trace_msg_user_b0b5df728a09", "turn_id": "msg_user_b0b5df728a09", "span_id": "sem_d1c84a2f068a41c8", "parent_span_id": "", "status": "completed", "summary": "Expert analysis produced a response.", "live_observed": true, "detail_level": "semantic", "occurred_at": "2026-06-26T06:43:06.578222+00:00", "actor": {"agent_id": "analysis"}, "subject": {}, "blueprint": {"agent_blueprint_id": "earthscope-gnss-region", "parent_expert": "main"}, "provider": {"provider_id": "", "model_id": ""}, "payload": {"selected_expert": "analysis", "route_source": "agent_blueprint", "route_reason": "Session selected Agent Blueprint expert 'analysis'.", "answer": "(Delegating to gnss_timeseries_analysis expert for CSV profiling; full analysis pending.)", "expert_handoffs": [], "tools_called": [], "file_diffs": [], "error_info": null, "reasoning": "The analysis orchestrator has received a staged GNSS time-series CSV (MTA1, 50.4 MB, analysis-ready) and is tasked with profiling it and assessing station suitability for regional ground deformation and seismic activity analysis.\n\n**Required work:**\n1. Profile the staged GNSS CSV through `gnss_timeseries_analysis` (mandatory)\n2. Assess station/network suitability through `station_network_analysis` (mandatory)\n\n**Optional work:**\nThe user's original request explicitly asked to \"Explore recent seismic activity around Los Angeles\" and \"find public EarthScope or earthquake catalog evidence\" and \"analyze the events and station context.\" This satisfies the criterion: \"request seismic_event_catalog only when the user explicitly asks for earthquakes, event catalogs, magnitudes, depths, epicenters...\"\n\nTherefore, after profiling and assessing the station, I should also request seismic event context to fulfill the full request.\n\n**Routing sequence:**\n1. Start with `gnss_timeseries_analysis` to profile the CSV (first required step)\n2. Follow with `station_network_analysis` to assess suitability\n3. Then optionally request `seismic_event_catalog` for event context\n4. Finally finish with synthesized answer\n\nBeginning with the first required child: profile the staged MTA1 time-series."}}}

