\n- With 1 Hz sampling and 250k rows, file likely spans ~69 hours, but this is not verified\n- Missing-value status is for profiled rows only\n\nI have sufficient evidence to complete the profiling task and return the results to the parent analysis orchestrator, which will then route to station_network_analysis and other downstream steps.\n</thinking>", "reasoning": "", "tool_name": "finish", "tool_args": {}, "observation": "Completed.", "is_finish": true}}}

