e or complete temporal coverage\n- **Missing-value scope**: Zero nulls reported for profiled 5000 rows; missing-value status of full 250,000-row file not assessed\n- **Quality flag not decoded**: qChannel values are opaque numeric statistics; interpretation requires external metadata\n\n"}}}

