profiled sample only):**\n- Time range in 5,000-row sample: 1733184000000 to 1733189070000 ms (Unix)\n- Sample span: ~1.4 hours (Dec 3, 2024, 00:00\u201301:24 UTC, profiled portion)\n- Sample rows show 1000 ms increments, suggesting local 1 Hz sampling\n\n**Data Quality (profiled rows):**\n- Null values: zero across all columns in profiled 5000 rows\n- qChannel present: values range 1314021\u20132411021 (opaque quality flag, not decoded)\n\n**Critical Limitations:**\n- **Scan-limited profiling**: Only 5,000 of 250,000 rows examined for statistics; min/max/mean ranges are scope-limited to profiled rows\n- **Full-file cadence/duration not verified**: Time span and sampling rates reported only for profiled portion; cannot confirm file-wide 1 Hz cadence or complete temporal coverage\n- **Missing-value scope**: Zero nulls reported for profiled 5000 rows; missing-value status of full 250,000-row file not assessed\n- **Quality flag not decoded**: qChannel values are opaque numeric statistics; interpretation requires external metadata", "expert_handoffs": [], "tools_called": [{"name": "pandas_profile_csv", "args": {"data_path": "/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv", "columns": null, "max_rows": null}, "ok": true, "telemetry_source": "agent_trajectory", "result": "{\"success\": true, \"file_path\": \"/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv\", \"size_bytes\": 50424246, \"columns\": [\"time\", \"east\", \"north\", \"up\", \"sigEE\", \"sigNN\", \"sigUU\", \"qChannel\"], \"column_count\": 8, \"row_count\": 250000, \"rows_profiled\": 5000, \"row_scan_cap\": 250000, \"scan_limited\": true, \"profile_limited\": true, \"dtypes\": {\"time\": \"integer\", \"east\": \"float\", \"north\": \"float\", \"up\": \"float\", \"sigEE\": \"float\", \"sigNN\": \"float\", \"sigUU\": \"float\", \"qChannel\": \"integer\"}, \"null_counts\": {\"time\": 0, \"east