036\", \"sigUU\": \"0.063\", \"qChannel\": \"1414021\"}], \"message\": \"Profiled 8 columns across 5000 of 250000 scanned rows\"}"}], "file_diffs": [], "error_info": null, "trajectory": {"thought_0": "I have received the workflow state with the staged MTA1 GNSS time-series CSV. The `acquisition.local_path` field contains the exact path to the staged file:\n`/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv`\n\nAccording to the system prompt STEP 1, I must use this exact path verbatim \u2014 no transformations, no invented paths. The file was staged by `ndp_stage_resource` and exists on disk.\n\nI will now call `pandas_profile_csv` with this exact path to:\n1. Determine row count and columns present\n2. Identify required displacement columns (east, north, up) and uncertainty columns (sigEE, sigNN, sigUU)\n3. Get numeric value ranges (min/max/mean) for all numeric columns\n4. Understand temporal coverage and sampling from the data values\n5. Report scan-limited profile evidence (rows examined vs. rows profiled for statistics)\n\nThis profiling will provide the evidence needed to assess station suitability and temporal coverage.\n</thinking>", "tool_name_0": "pandas_profile_csv", "tool_args_0": {"data_path": "/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv", "columns": null, "max_rows": null}, "observation_0": "{\"success\": true, \"file_path\": \"/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv\", \"size_bytes\": 50424246, \"columns\": [\"time\", \"east\", \"north\", \"up\", \"sigEE\", \"sigNN\", \"sigUU\", \"qChannel\"], \"column_count\": 8, \"row_count\": 250000, \"rows_profiled\": 5000, \"row_scan_cap\": 250000, \"scan_limited\": true, \"profile_limited\": true, \"dtypes\": {\"time\": \"integer\", \"east\": \"float\", \"north\": \"float\", \"up\": \"float\", \"sigEE\": \"float\", \"sigNN\