EE: 0.032\u20130.035 m (mean: 0.033 m \u2248 3.3 cm)\n- sigNN: 0.032\u20130.036 m (mean: 0.033 m \u2248 3.3 cm)\n- sigUU: 0.062\u20130.066 m (mean: 0.065 m \u2248 6.5 cm)\n\n**Temporal Coverage (profiled sample only):**\n- Time range in 5,000-row sample: 1733184000000 to 1733189070000 ms (Unix)\n- Sample span: ~1.4 hours (Dec 3, 2024, 00:00\u201301:24 UTC, profiled portion)\n- Sample rows show 1000 ms increments, suggesting local 1 Hz sampling\n\n**Data Quality (profiled rows):**\n- Null values: zero across all columns in profiled 5000 rows\n- qChannel present: values range 1314021\u20132411021 (opaque quality flag, not decoded)\n\n**Critical Limitations:**\n- **Scan-limited profiling**: Only 5,000 of 250,000 rows examined for statistics; min/max/mean ranges are scope-limited to profiled rows\n- **Full-file cadence/duration not verified**: Time span and sampling rates reported only for profiled portion; cannot confirm file-wide 1 Hz cadence or complete temporal coverage\n- **Missing-value scope**: Zero nulls reported for profiled 5000 rows; missing-value status of full 250,000-row file not assessed\n- **Quality flag not decoded**: qChannel values are opaque numeric statistics; interpretation requires external metadata", "workflow_state": {"acquisition": {"analysis_ready": true, "local_path": "/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv", "metadata_path": "/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/earthscope_stations_clean.csv", "metadata_source_url": "https://nationaldataplatform.org/catalog/dataset/811f0bcc-99e5-455c-bcf6-7c63c2634f41/resource/a420cc30-2262-423a-8c63-3ad8d91f2a8f/download/earthscope_converted_data.csv", "size_bytes": 50424246, "source_url": "https://ds2.datacollaboratory.org/Earthscope_api_dec2024/raw_csv/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv", "status": "staged"}, "catalog": {"status": "metadata_found"}, "completed_stages": ["geospatial", "data"], "geospa