evidence\" and to \"analyze the events\")\n\nThe next required child is `station_network_analysis` to assess MTA1's suitability for regional deformation and seismic analysis. This step will evaluate the station's geographic positioning (0.3 km from LA region center), distance from tectonic features, network coverage context, and data fitness for the requested analysis."}}}

