event: semantic.event
id: 241
data: {"type": "semantic.event", "occurred_at": "2026-06-26T06:46:13.801847+00:00", "payload": {"schema_version": "clio.semantic_event.v1", "event_id": "sem_ac1506817a2e493a", "event_type": "expert.response.completed", "session_id": "sess_57ac84d71ca3", "workspace_id": "ws_22a00fecef95", "trace_id": "trace_msg_user_b0b5df728a09", "turn_id": "msg_user_b0b5df728a09", "span_id": "sem_ac1506817a2e493a", "parent_span_id": "", "status": "completed", "summary": "Expert main produced a response.", "live_observed": true, "detail_level": "semantic", "occurred_at": "2026-06-26T06:46:13.788392+00:00", "actor": {"agent_id": "main"}, "subject": {}, "blueprint": {"agent_blueprint_id": "earthscope-gnss-region", "parent_expert": ""}, "provider": {"provider_id": "", "model_id": ""}, "payload": {"selected_expert": "main", "route_source": "agent_blueprint", "route_reason": "Session selected Agent Blueprint expert 'main'.", "answer": "(Delegating to visualization expert for PNG artifact creation; synthesis pending.)", "expert_handoffs": [], "tools_called": [], "file_diffs": [], "error_info": null, "reasoning": "The main orchestrator has successfully completed three critical stages:\n\n1. \u2713 **geospatial**: Resolved Los Angeles region (34.0536909\u00b0N, -118.242766\u00b0W, 100 km radius)\n2. \u2713 **data**: Staged MTA1 GNSS time-series CSV (50.4 MB, 250,000 rows, all required displacement/uncertainty columns)\n3. \u2713 **analysis**: Profiled CSV, confirmed station suitability, documented event-context capability gap\n\n**Current workflow state:**\n- Staged CSV path confirmed and analysis-ready\n- Station suitability assessment complete\n- Profile evidence complete (scan-limited, but comprehensive)\n- Event-context blocker properly documented\n\n**Remaining pipeline stages:**\nThe user's original request explicitly asks to \"produce an artifact suitable for discussion\" \u2014 this is a visualization requirement. Per the system prompt: \"Asks to PLOT / chart / visualize displacement \u2192 also run `visualization`.\"\n\nThe remaining workflow is:\n1. **visualization**: Create PNG time-series plot from the staged MTA1 CSV\n2. **synthesis**: Merge all evidence into the final user-facing answer\n\nBoth stages are required to complete the full pipeline the user requested."}}}

