data: {"type": "message.part.added", "occurred_at": "2026-06-26T06:46:14.152823+00:00", "payload": {"turn_id": "msg_user_b0b5df728a09", "message_id": "msg_asst_b3567fb7ada5", "stream_source": "live", "part": {"id": "live_handoff_0164a329b983", "type": "expert_handoff", "metadata": {"delegate_to": "visualization", "agent_id": "visualization", "question": "Create a time-series visualization (PNG artifact) from the staged MTA1 GNSS CSV at `/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv`. Plot the three displacement components (east, north, up) as time-series, with temporal axis from the time column (Unix milliseconds) and displacement values in meters. Include uncertainty bounds (sigEE, sigNN, sigUU) where feasible. The plot should be suitable for discussion of regional GNSS deformation patterns at the MTA1 station (0.3 km from Los Angeles region center, 34.0536909\u00b0N, -118.242766\u00b0W). Save the artifact within the active workspace root.", "status": "running", "execute": true, "source": "agent_next_expert", "parent_id": "main", "pack_id": "earthscope-gnss-region", "pack_version": "0.1.0", "stage": "delegate.started", "delegation_lifecycle": "sync", "depth": 0, "execution_mode": "blueprint_react", "stream_source": "live"}, "agent_id": "main", "text": "main -> visualization", "parent_agent": "main", "child_agent": "visualization", "stage": "delegate.started", "status": "running"}}}

event: semantic.event
id: 244
data: {"type": "semantic.event", "occurred_at": "2026-06-26T06:46:14.778460+00:00", "payload": {"schema_version": "clio.semantic_event.v1", "event_id": "sem_bdc85c1c9e90499e", "event_type": "expert.lifecycle.started", "session_id": "sess_57ac84d71ca3", "workspace_id": "ws_22a00fecef95", "trace_id": "trace_msg_user_b0b5df728a09", "turn_id": "msg_user_b0b5df728a09", "span_id": "sem_bdc85c1c9e90499e", "parent_span_id": "", "status": "running", "summary": "expert visualization started", "live_observed": true, "detail_level": "semantic", "occurred_at": "2026-06-26T06:46:14.766567+00:00", "actor": {"agent_id": "visualization", "role": "expert"}, "subject": {}, "blueprint": {}, "provider": {}, "payload": {"expert_id": "visualization", "expert_span_id": "fed24e6b5cf64641", "input": {"question": "Create a time-series visualization (PNG artifact) from the staged MTA1 GNSS CSV at `/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv`. Plot the three displacement components (east, north, up) as time-series, with temporal axis from the time column (Unix milliseconds) and displacement values in meters. Include uncertainty bounds (sigEE, sigNN, sigUU) where feasible. The plot should be suitable for discussion of regional GNSS deformation patterns at the MTA1 station (0.3 km from Los Angeles region center, 34.0536909\u00b0N, -118.242766\u00b0W). Save the artifact within the active workspace root.\n\nParent evidence available for this delegated task:\n\n(Delegating to visualization expert for PNG artifact creation; synthesis pending.)\n\nAccumulated typed workflow state from prior CLIO tool evidence (authoritative; use this before local prose summaries):\n{\"workflow_state\": {\"acquisition\": {\"analysis_ready\": true, \"local_path\": \"/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv\", \"metadata_path\": \"/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/earthscope_stations_clean.csv\", \"metadata_source_url\": \"https://nationaldataplatform.org/catalog/dataset/811f0bcc-99e5-455c-bcf6-7c63c2634f41/resource/a420cc30-2262-423a-8c63-3ad8d91f2a8f/download/earthscope_converted_data.csv\", \"size_bytes\": 50424246, \"source_url\": \"https://ds2.datacollaboratory.org/Earthscope_api_dec2024/raw_csv/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv\", \"status\": \"staged\"}, \"catalog\": {\"status\": \"metadata_found\"}, \"completed_stages\": [\"geospatial\", \"data\", \"analysis\"], \"event_context\": {\"blocker\": \"no live event catalog tool available in this pack\", \"limitations\": [\"no_live_event_catalog_tool\"], \"next_action\": \"add or call a live earthquake/event catalog tool (e.g., USGS Earthquake Hazards Program API) for event counts, magnitudes, depths, and dates\", \"status\": \"blocked\", \"verified_event_count\": null}, \"geospatial\": {\"bbox\": [-118.6681798, 33.659541, -118.1552983, 34.337306], \"center_lat\": 34.0536909, \"center_lon\": -118.242766, \"confidence\": \"high\", \"provenance\": \"osm_nominatim\", \"radius_km\": 100, \"region_name\": \"Los Angeles, Los Angeles County, California, United States\", \"status\": \"resolved\", \"warnings\": [\"Default radius of 100 km assumed for regional GNSS station discovery and seismic event analysis; no explicit radius specified in user request\"]}, \"network_analysis\": {\"assessment\": \"MTA1 is geographically optimal at 0.3 km from region center with complete data structure for displacement analysis. Uncertainties in profiled sample are centimeter-scale (3.3 cm horizontal, 6.5 cm vertical). Profile is scan-limited; full-file cadence/duration not verified.\", \"network_context\": \"155 ranked stations available; MTA1 is closest; fallback stations (PKRD 2.2 km, ELSC 4.1 km) enable multi-station analysis if needed\", \"station_id\": \"MTA1\", \"status\": \"preliminary_suitability_confirmed\"}, \"orchestrator_step\": \"delegating_to_visualization\", \"profile\": {\"path\": \"/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv\", \"scan_limite...", "system_prompt": "# GNSS Visualization Expert\n\nCreate a real PNG from the staged station time-series CSV(s).\n\n## The data path(s) come from workflow state \u2014 never invent them\n\nPlot the station CSV(s) the resolver staged: `acquisition.local_path`, plus every path\nin `acquisition.local_paths` when several stations were staged. These are exact\n`ndp_stage_resource` results under the Active workspace root (e.g.\n`<workspace>/P475.CI.LY_.20.csv`). Copy them verbatim \u2014 never guess, abbreviate, or\nbuild a city/region-named path (`san_diego.csv`, `<city>_stations.csv`). Only a path\nthat appeared in successful staging evidence is valid.\n\n## Discover the columns, then plot\n\nFirst call `pandas_profile_csv` on the staged CSV to learn its EXACT column names (or\nread `profile.columns` from analysis state). A GNSS file exposes a time column and\n`east`, `north`, `up`; confirm each name against the profile before using it. Pass the\nreal time column as `x_column` and the requested displacement column(s) as `y_columns`\n(default east/north/up) \u2014 only names that appear in the profile.\n\nCall `plot_plot_timeseries` with an explicit ABSOLUTE `output_path` under the Active\nworkspace root (same directory as the staged CSV, station-named, `.png`); without it\nthe artifact does not resolve to a real file and is lost. To plot ONE station, pass its\nCSV as `data_path`. To compare SEVERAL on one figure, pass the first as `data_path` and\nthe others as `overlay_paths` \u2014 the tool overlays them on shared axes, labelled per\nstation.\n\nCite the exact `output_path` the tool returns. Do not claim a figure exists unless\n`plot_plot_timeseries` succeeded with that path. A successful plot proves only that the\nselected columns were plotted for the returned rows \u2014 not full-file completeness,\ngap-free data, cadence, or low noise; do not assert those.\n\nAfter success, include parent-consumable JSON evidence:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"workflow_state\": {\n    \"artifact\": {\n      \"status\": \"ready\",\n      \"path\": \"<exact PNG output_path>\",\n      \"kind\": \"gnss_timeseries_plot\",\n      \"columns\": []\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\nActive workspace root: /tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws\nWrite generated artifacts (files, charts, exports) inside the active workspace root using absolute paths so they stay with the session. Read inputs from wherever the user points you.\nWrites are only permitted under: /tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws, /tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run."}}}}

