data: {"type": "semantic.event", "occurred_at": "2026-06-26T06:46:27.254218+00:00", "payload": {"schema_version": "clio.semantic_event.v1", "event_id": "sem_8585dccbffdb4e7f", "event_type": "react.step.completed", "session_id": "sess_57ac84d71ca3", "workspace_id": "ws_22a00fecef95", "trace_id": "trace_msg_user_b0b5df728a09", "turn_id": "msg_user_b0b5df728a09", "span_id": "sem_8585dccbffdb4e7f", "parent_span_id": "fed24e6b5cf64641", "status": "completed", "summary": "visualization ReAct step 0: pandas_profile_csv", "live_observed": true, "detail_level": "semantic", "occurred_at": "2026-06-26T06:46:27.240642+00:00", "actor": {"agent_id": "visualization", "role": "expert"}, "subject": {}, "blueprint": {}, "provider": {}, "payload": {"expert_id": "visualization", "expert_span_id": "fed24e6b5cf64641", "step_span_id": "5ff69de845c04c79", "step_index": 0, "thought": "I need to create a PNG time-series visualization from the staged MTA1 GNSS CSV. According to the system prompt, I should:\n\n1. First call `pandas_profile_csv` on the staged CSV to confirm exact column names\n2. Then call `plot_plot_timeseries` to create the plot\n\nFrom the workflow state, I know:\n- Staged CSV path: `/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv`\n- The file has columns: time (Unix ms), east, north, up, sigEE, sigNN, sigUU, qChannel\n- The profile shows all required displacement columns are present\n\nI'll start by profiling the CSV to confirm column names, then create a plot of the three displacement components (east, north, up) against time.\n</thinking>", "reasoning": "", "tool_name": "pandas_profile_csv", "tool_args": {"data_path": "/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv", "columns": null, "max_rows": null}, "observation": "{\"success\": true, \"file_path\": \"/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv\", \"size_bytes\": 50424246, \"columns\": [\"time\", \"east\", \"north\", \"up\", \"sigEE\", \"sigNN\", \"sigUU\", \"qChannel\"], \"column_count\": 8, \"row_count\": 250000, \"rows_profiled\": 5000, \"row_scan_cap\": 250000, \"scan_limited\": true, \"profile_limited\": true, \"dtypes\": {\"time\": \"integer\", \"east\": \"float\", \"north\": \"float\", \"up\": \"float\", \"sigEE\": \"float\", \"sigNN\": \"float\", \"sigUU\": \"float\", \"qChannel\": \"integer\"}, \"null_counts\": {\"time\": 0, \"east\": 0, \"north\": 0, \"up\": 0, \"sigEE\": 0, \"sigNN\": 0, \"sigUU\": 0, \"qChannel\": 0}, \"numeric_summary\": {\"time\": {\"count\": 5000, \"min\": 1733184000000.0, \"max\": 1733189070000.0, \"mean\": 1733186553460.0}, \"east\": {\"count\": 5000, \"min\": -0.07, \"max\": -0.03, \"mean\": -0.0472322}, \"north\": {\"count\": 5000, \"min\": 0.029, \"max\": 0.058, \"mean\": 0.0453112}, \"up\": {\"count\": 5000, \"min\": 0.051, \"max\": 0.224, \"mean\": 0.13575399999999999}, \"sigEE\": {\"count\": 5000, \"min\": 0.032, \"max\": 0.035, \"mean\": 0.0333566}, \"sigNN\": {\"count\": 5000, \"min\": 0.032, \"max\": 0.036, \"mean\": 0.032995}, \"sigUU\": {\"count\": 5000, \"min\": 0.062, \"max\": 0.066, \"mean\": 0.065082}, \"qChannel\": {\"count\": 5000, \"min\": 1314021.0, \"max\": 2411021.0, \"mean\": 1847151.6}}, \"sample_rows\": [{\"time\": \"1733184000000\", \"east\": \"-0.049\", \"north\": \"0.054\", \"up\": \"0.217\", \"sigEE\": \"0.033\", \"sigNN\": \"0.036\", \"sigUU\": \"0.063\", \"qChannel\": \"1414021\"}, {\"time\": \"1733184001000\", \"east\": \"-0.049\", \"north\": \"0.054\", \"up\": \"0.217\", \"sigEE\": \"0.033\", \"sigNN\": \"0.036\", \"sigUU\": \"0.063\", \"qChannel\": \"1414021\"}, {\"time\": \"1733184002000\", \"east\": \"-0.05\", \"north\": \"0.054\", \"up\": \"0.217\", \"sigEE\": \"0.033\", \"sigNN\": \"0.036\", \"sigUU\": \"0.063\", \"qChannel\": \"1414021\"}], \"message\": \"Profiled 8 columns across 5000 of 250000 scanned rows\"}", "is_finish"