 visualization from the staged MTA1 GNSS CSV. According to the system prompt, I should:\n\n1. First call `pandas_profile_csv` on the staged CSV to confirm exact column names\n2. Then call `plot_plot_timeseries` to create the plot\n\nFrom the workflow state, I know:\n- Staged CSV path: `/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv`\n- The file has columns: time (Unix ms), east, north, up, sigEE, sigNN, sigUU, qChannel\n- The profile shows all required displacement columns are present\n\nI'll start by profiling the CSV to confirm column names, then create a plot of the three displacement components (east, north, up) against time.\n</thinking>", "tool_name_0": "pandas_profile_csv", "tool_args_0": {"data_path": "/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv", "columns": null, "max_rows": null}, "observation_0": "{\"success\": true, \"file_path\": \"/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv\", \"size_bytes\": 50424246, \"columns\": [\"time\", \"east\", \"north\", \"up\", \"sigEE\", \"sigNN\", \"sigUU\", \"qChannel\"], \"column_count\": 8, \"row_count\": 250000, \"rows_profiled\": 5000, \"row_scan_cap\": 250000, \"scan_limited\": true, \"profile_limited\": true, \"dtypes\": {\"time\": \"integer\", \"east\": \"float\", \"north\": \"float\", \"up\": \"float\", \"sigEE\": \"float\", \"sigNN\": \"float\", \"sigUU\": \"float\", \"qChannel\": \"integer\"}, \"null_counts\": {\"time\": 0, \"east\": 0, \"north\": 0, \"up\": 0, \"sigEE\": 0, \"sigNN\": 0, \"sigUU\": 0, \"qChannel\": 0}, \"numeric_summary\": {\"time\": {\"count\": 5000, \"min\": 1733184000000.0, \"max\": 1733189070000.0, \"mean\": 1733186553460.0}, \"east\": {\"count\": 5000, \"min\": -0.07, \"max\": -0.03, \"mean\": -0.0472322}, \"north\": {\"count\": 5000, \"min\": 0.029, \"max\": 0.058, \"mean\": 0.0453112}, \"up\": {\"cou