ad/la_run/ws/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv", "x_column": "time", "y_columns": ["east", "north", "up"], "output_path": "/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/MTA1_displacement_timeseries.png", "title": "MTA1 GNSS Displacement Time-Series (Los Angeles Region, 0.3 km from center)", "max_rows": 2000}, "observation_1": "{\"status\": \"success\", \"plot_type\": \"timeseries\", \"output_path\": \"/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/MTA1_displacement_timeseries.png\", \"x_column\": \"time\", \"x_axis\": {\"kind\": \"epoch_milliseconds\", \"label\": \"time (UTC)\", \"parse_success_ratio\": 1.0}, \"y_columns\": [\"east\", \"north\", \"up\"], \"files\": [\"/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv\"], \"title\": \"MTA1 GNSS Displacement Time-Series (Los Angeles Region, 0.3 km from center)\", \"data_points\": 2000}", "thought_2": "Excellent! The plot_plot_timeseries tool succeeded and created the PNG artifact at the exact output path. The tool report shows:\n- status: \"success\"\n- output_path: \"/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/MTA1_displacement_timeseries.png\"\n- x_column: \"time\" (parsed as epoch_milliseconds UTC)\n- y_columns: [\"east\", \"north\", \"up\"] successfully plotted\n- data_points: 2000 (subset of the 250,000 total rows)\n- title: \"MTA1 GNSS Displacement Time-Series (Los Angeles Region, 0.3 km from center)\"\n\nThe visualization is complete and ready for parent consumption. I now have all the information needed to finish the visualization task and provide the artifact evidence to the parent orchestrator.\n</thinking>", "tool_name_2": "finish", "tool_args_2": {}, "observation_2": "Completed."}, "reasoning": "The visualization expert successfully created a PNG time-series plot from the staged MTA1 GNSS CSV. The workflow was:\n\n1. **Profile step**: Called `pandas_profile_csv` to confirm exact column names. Result showed 8 columns (time, east, north, up, sigEE, sigNN, sigUU, qChannel) across 250,000 total rows with 5,000 rows profiled. All required displacement and uncertainty columns present with zero nulls.\n\n2. **Plot step**: Called `plot_plot_timeseries` with:\n   - data_path: staged MTA1 CSV (exact path from acquisition.local_path)\n   - x_column: \"time\" (Unix milliseconds, parsed as epoch_milliseconds UTC)\n   - y_columns: [\"east\", \"north\", \"up\"] (three displacement components in meters)\n   - output_path: absolute path in workspace root\n   - title: descriptive title for LA region deformation discussion\n\n3. **Result**: PNG artifact successfully created at the specified output path with 2,000 data points plotted (representative subset of 250,000-row file). Plot is scan-limited; full-file cadence/duration/completeness not verified."}}}

