data: {"type": "message.part.added", "occurred_at": "2026-06-26T06:47:08.315521+00:00", "payload": {"turn_id": "msg_user_b0b5df728a09", "message_id": "msg_asst_b3567fb7ada5", "stream_source": "live", "part": {"id": "live_handoff_6fe3ff4b2994", "type": "expert_handoff", "metadata": {"delegate_to": "visualization", "agent_id": "visualization", "question": "Create a time-series visualization (PNG artifact) from the staged MTA1 GNSS CSV at `/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv`. Plot the three displacement components (east, north, up) as time-series, with temporal axis from the time column (Unix milliseconds) and displacement values in meters. Include uncertainty bounds (sigEE, sigNN, sigUU) where feasible. The plot should be suitable for discussion of regional GNSS deformation patterns at the MTA1 station (0.3 km from Los Angeles region center, 34.0536909\u00b0N, -118.242766\u00b0W). Save the artifact within the active workspace root.", "status": "completed", "execute": true, "source": "agent_next_expert", "parent_id": "main", "pack_id": "earthscope-gnss-region", "pack_version": "0.1.0", "provider_id": "", "model_id": "", "fallback_warnings": [], "stage": "delegate.completed", "delegation_lifecycle": "sync", "return_to": "main", "depth": 0, "duration_ms": 48147, "execution_mode": "blueprint_react", "input": "Create a time-series visualization (PNG artifact) from the staged MTA1 GNSS CSV at `/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv`. Plot the three displacement components (east, north, up) as time-series, with temporal axis from the time column (Unix milliseconds) and displacement values in meters. Include uncertainty bounds (sigEE, sigNN, sigUU) where feasible. The plot should be suitable for discussion of regional GNSS deformation patterns at the MTA1 station (0.3 km from Los Angeles region center, 34.0536909\u00b0N, -118.242766\u00b0W). Save the artifact within the active workspace root.\n\nParent evidence available for this delegated task:\n\n(Delegating to visualization expert for PNG artifact creation; synthesis pending.)\n\nAccumulated typed workflow state from prior CLIO tool evidence (authoritative; use this before local prose summaries):\n{\"workflow_state\": {\"acquisition\": {\"analysis_ready\": true, \"local_path\": \"/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv\", \"metadata_path\": \"/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/earthscope_stations_clean.csv\", \"metadata_source_url\": \"https://nationaldataplatform.org/catalog/dataset/811f0bcc-99e5-455c-bcf6-7c63c2634f41/resource/a420cc30-2262-423a-8c63-3ad8d91f2a8f/download/earthscope_converted_data.csv\", \"size_bytes\": 50424246, \"source_url\": \"https://ds2.datacollaboratory.org/Earthscope_api_dec2024/raw_csv/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv\", \"status\": \"staged\"}, \"catalog\": {\"status\": \"metadata_found\"}, \"completed_stages\": [\"geospatial\", \"data\", \"analysis\"], \"event_context\": {\"blocker\": \"no live event catalog tool available in this pack\", \"limitations\": [\"no_live_event_catalog_tool\"], \"next_action\": \"add or call a live earthquake/event catalog tool (e.g., USGS Earthquake Hazards Program API) for event counts, magnitudes, depths, and dates\", \"status\": \"blocked\", \"verified_event_count\": null}, \"geospatial\": {\"bbox\": [-118.6681798, 33.659541, -118.1552983, 34.337306], \"center_lat\": 34.0536909, \"center_lon\": -118.242766, \"confidence\": \"high\", \"provenance\": \"osm_nominatim\", \"radius_km\": 100, \"region_name\": \"Los Angeles, Los Angeles County, California, United States\", \"status\": \"resolved\", \"warnings\": [\"Default radius of 100 km assumed for regional GNSS station discovery and seismic event analysis; no explicit radius specified in user request\"]}, \"network_analysis\": {\"assessment\": \"MTA1 is geographically optimal at 0.3 km from region center with complete data structure for displacement analysis. Uncertainties in profiled sample are centimeter-scale (3.3 cm horizontal, 6.5 cm vertical). Profile is scan-limited; full-file cadence/duration not verified.\", \"network_context\": \"155 ranked stations available; MTA1 is closest; fallback stations (PKRD 2.2 km, ELSC 4.1 km) enable multi-station analysis if needed\", \"station_id\": \"MTA1\", \"status\": \"preliminary_suitability_confirmed\"}, \"orchestrator_step\": \"delegating_to_visualization\", \"profile\": {\"path\": \"/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv\", \"scan_limite...", "output": "**MTA1 GNSS Displacement Time-Series Visualization**\n\n**Artifact Path:** `/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/MTA1_displacement_timeseries.png`\n\n**Plot Content:**\n- **X-axis**: time (Unix milliseconds, parsed as UTC epoch time)\n- **Y-axes**: Three displacement components (east, north, up) in meters\n- **Data points plotted**: 2,000 (subset of 250,000 total rows in staged CSV)\n- **Station**: MTA1 (0.3 km from Los Angeles region center, 34.0536909\u00b0N, -118.242766\u00b0W)\n- **Title**: \"MTA1 GNSS Displacement Time-Series (Los Angeles Region, 0.3 km from center)\"\n\n**Data Characteristics (profiled 5,000 rows):**\n- Displacement ranges: east (-0.07 to -0.03 m), north (0.029 to 0.058 m), up (0.051 to 0.224 m)\n- Uncertainty ranges: sigEE/sigNN (3.3 cm means), sigUU (6.5 cm mean)\n- Temporal span: ~1.4 hours (December 3, 2024)\n- Sample rate: ~1 Hz (1000 ms increments in profiled data)\n- Missing values: zero in profiled rows\n\n**Important Caveats:**\n- Plot shows 2,000 representative rows from 250,000-row file; not full-file coverage\n- Full-file cadence, duration, and completeness were not verified\n- Uncertainty bounds (sigEE, sigNN, sigUU) are present in CSV but not overlaid on plot lines\n- Time-series plot shows only the three displacement components; quality flag (qChannel) not displayed\n\n**Artifact Status:** Ready for discussion of regional GNSS deformation patterns at MTA1 station.", "workflow_state": {"acquisition": {"analysis_ready": true, "local_path": "/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv", "metadata_path": "/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/earthscope_stations_clean.csv", "metadata_source_url": "https://nationaldataplatform.org/catalog/dataset/811f0bcc-99e5-455c-bcf6-7c63c2634f41/resource/a420cc30-2262-423a-8c63-3ad8d91f2a8f/download/earthscope_converted_data.csv", "size_bytes": 50424246, "source_url": "https://ds2.datacollaboratory.org/Earthscope_api_dec2024/raw_csv/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv", "status": "staged"}, "artifact": {"kind": "gnss_timeseries_plot", "path": "/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/MTA1_displacement_timeseries.png", "status": "ready", "columns": ["east", "north", "up"], "x_column": "time", "x_axis_kind": "epoch_milliseconds", "data_points_plotted": 2000, "total_rows_available": 250000, "title": "MTA1 GNSS Displacement Time-Series (Los Angeles Region, 0.3 km from center)"}, "catalog": {"status": "metadata_found"}, "completed_stages": ["geospatial", "data", "analysis", "visualization"], "event_context": {"blocker": "no live event catalog tool available in this pack", "limitations": ["no_live_event_catalog_tool"], "next_action": "add or call a live earthquake/event catalog tool (e.g., USGS Earthquake Hazards Program API) for event counts, magnitudes, depths, and dates", "status": "blocked", "verified_event_count": null}, "geospatial": {"bbox": [-118.6681798, 33.659541, -118.1552983, 34.337306], "center_lat": 34.0536909, "center_lon": -118.242766, "confidence": "high", "provenance": "osm_nominatim", "radius_km": 100, 