ing requirement:**\nThe system prompt is explicit: \"`synthesis` is ALWAYS the last child, and you finish on the turn AFTER it returns, carrying its answer.\" The final user-facing answer must be written by the synthesis expert, not the orchestrator. Synthesis must merge all grounded evidence (geospatial resolution, staged data sources, profile findings, artifact path, event-context blocker) into a comprehensive answer suitable for discussion.\n\n**Next step:** Route to synthesis with complete workflow state and instruction to write final answer."}}}

