and temporal patterns for the LA region cannot be retrieved. GNSS observations cannot be cross-correlated with known seismic events.\n\n**Profile coverage:** Only 5,000 of 250,000 rows examined for min/max/mean statistics. Full-file temporal span, sampling cadence, and gap structure were not verified.\n\n**Plot coverage:** PNG displays 2,000 representative data points (subset of 250,000-row file). Complete temporal coverage not verified.\n\n**Uncertainty display:** sigEE/sigNN/sigUU uncertainty columns present in CSV but not graphically overlaid on displacement traces in the plot.\n\n**Quality flag:** qChannel numeric values present in CSV but not decoded or assessed; full-file data-quality interpretation not performed.\n\nAll paths, URLs, and numeric ranges copied verbatim from staged NDP resources.", "workflow_state": {"resource_candidate": {"status": "selected", "station_id": "MTA1", "geographically_grounded": true}, "acquisition": {"status": "staged", "analysis_ready": true, "local_path": "/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv", "source_url": "https://ds2.datacollaboratory.org/Earthscope_api_dec2024/raw_csv/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv", "size_bytes": 50424246}, "profile": {"status": "complete", "rows_scanned": 5000}, "artifact": {"status": "ready", "path": "/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/MTA1_displacement_timeseries.png"}}, "tools_called": [], "children": []}}}

